  "name": "Alextrasza's Fury",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your hands burst into flames as you push a roaring wave of fire outward from yourself. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 12d6 fire damage and is stunned until the end of their next turn. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage and isn't stunned. The fire spreads around corners. It ignites flammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried. A creature killed by this spell is reduced to ash.</p>",
